WEBVTT

00:30:57.729 --> 00:31:00.794
and it hasn't been the experience
of a lot of women that I know.

00:31:00.818 --> 00:31:03.094
And I wanted to write about
this group of girls

00:31:03.118 --> 00:31:05.783
who are very careless, very wild,

00:31:05.807 --> 00:31:08.247
very irresponsible,

00:31:08.271 --> 00:31:13.006
and having kind of the time of their lives
when they're 19 and 20 years old

00:31:13.030 --> 00:31:14.194
in New York City,

00:31:14.218 --> 00:31:17.758
completely oblivious to the fact
that the world is burning all around them,

00:31:17.782 --> 00:31:20.372
that there are wars happening
and all of this disaster.

00:31:20.396 --> 00:31:23.289
So it's a book that the feeling
that I wanted it to have

00:31:23.313 --> 00:31:25.576
was that it goes down
like a tray of gin fizzes,

00:31:25.600 --> 00:31:27.930
that it's just giddy,

00:31:27.954 --> 00:31:29.838
giddy and gay and light.

00:31:29.862 --> 00:31:32.145
And there's a depth
that comes later in the book